  "title": "LegalZoom to Announce Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on Wednesday, August 5, 2026",
  "summary": "MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif., July 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- LegalZoom (Nasdaq: LZ), America’s #1 online legal services company, today announced it will report its financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026, on Wednesday, August 5, 2026, after the close of market.",
